Subject: Let a paired-microtile PRELOAD read indexed W rows

With gatherRows > 0 the ExecuteController samples a sideband entry at every io.cmd.fire and keeps it
in a queue beside the command queue, popped with it. A gathering PRELOAD reads D row idx from the
entry for idx < gatherRows and keeps rs1 + idx otherwise. Observation outputs report the gathered
reads and the residual rows fed to the mesh. With gatherRows = 0, the default, none of this exists.

